{"at": "2026-11-04 06:03:25", "sql": "INSERT INTO spec_item (item_id, item_kind, title, item_status, module, tags, applies_to, verified_by, supersedes, superseded_by, affects, body, search_text, source_path, source_line, revision, updated_at) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE item_kind=VALUES(item_kind), title=VALUES(title), item_status=VALUES(item_status), module=VALUES(module), tags=VALUES(tags), applies_to=VALUES(applies_to), verified_by=VALUES(verified_by), supersedes=VALUES(supersedes), superseded_by=VALUES(superseded_by), affects=VALUES(affects), body=VALUES(body), search_text=VALUES(search_text), source_path=VALUES(source_path), source_line=VALUES(source_line), revision=VALUES(revision), updated_at=VALUES(updated_at)", "params": ["REQ-ORD-004", "requirement", "未知字段向后兼容", "active", "order-query", "compatibility,contract,payload", "ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search", "tests/test_search_basic.py", "", "", "", "请求体中未定义的字段必须被忽略，不得因此返回 4xx。该规则保证旧客户端在服务端新增筛选项后仍然可用；\n新增筛选项本身不得放宽本规则。", "REQ-ORD-004 未知字段向后兼容 order-query compatibility contract payload ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search tests/test_s", "validation/spec-v2/order-query.md", "41", "7b2b32ae4d1ae075e290058af81173c70ca585b49144eaa4c840d8c52585c618", "2026-11-04 06:03:25"], "rows": 2}
