{"at": "2026-11-04 06:03:25", "sql": "INSERT INTO spec_item (item_id, item_kind, title, item_status, module, tags, applies_to, verified_by, supersedes, superseded_by, affects, body, search_text, source_path, source_line, revision, updated_at) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE item_kind=VALUES(item_kind), title=VALUES(title), item_status=VALUES(item_status), module=VALUES(module), tags=VALUES(tags), applies_to=VALUES(applies_to), verified_by=VALUES(verified_by), supersedes=VALUES(supersedes), superseded_by=VALUES(superseded_by), affects=VALUES(affects), body=VALUES(body), search_text=VALUES(search_text), source_path=VALUES(source_path), source_line=VALUES(source_line), revision=VALUES(revision), updated_at=VALUES(updated_at)", "params": ["REQ-ORD-014", "requirement", "订单应付金额区间筛选", "active", "order-query", "amount,range,filter,decimal,currency,payable", "ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search", "tests/test_amount_filter.py,tests/test_amount_validation.py", "REQ-ORD-009", "", "", "请求体新增三个可选字段：`amount_min`、`amount_max`、`currency`。\n\n金额口径为订单应付金额（订单的 `amount` 字段），不含运费与税费；不同币种的金额不得合并比较。\n\n1. `amount_min` ", "REQ-ORD-014 订单应付金额区间筛选 order-query amount range filter decimal currency payable ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.sea", "validation/spec-v2/order-query.md", "63", "4c37cc1cf75ac232a63c30805f3a24f2fcf1b9d6281d742d7e56840c4cdec7f0", "2026-11-04 06:03:25"], "rows": 2}
