{"at": "2026-11-04 07:47:54", "sql": "INSERT INTO spec_item (item_id, item_kind, title, item_status, module, tags, applies_to, verified_by, supersedes, superseded_by, affects, body, search_text, source_path, source_line, revision, updated_at) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE item_kind=VALUES(item_kind), title=VALUES(title), item_status=VALUES(item_status), module=VALUES(module), tags=VALUES(tags), applies_to=VALUES(applies_to), verified_by=VALUES(verified_by), supersedes=VALUES(supersedes), superseded_by=VALUES(superseded_by), affects=VALUES(affects), body=VALUES(body), search_text=VALUES(search_text), source_path=VALUES(source_path), source_line=VALUES(source_line), revision=VALUES(revision), updated_at=VALUES(updated_at)", "params": ["CTR-ORD-001", "contract", "搜索接口的错误响应", "active", "order-query", "error,contract,http,response", "ledgerflow.service.handle_search", "tests/test_pagination.py,tests/test_amount_validation.py", "", "", "", "可预期的入参错误必须返回 HTTP 400 与统一错误体：\n\n```json\n{\"error\": {\"code\": \"<ERROR_CODE>\", \"message\": \"<可读说明>\"}}\n```\n\n`code` 取值受控：`INVALI", "CTR-ORD-001 搜索接口的错误响应 order-query error contract http response ledgerflow.service.handle_search tests/test_pagination.py", "specs/api-contract.md", "3", "7a744a82631046668fbb0e64d8fff2ffc15c50212a7895a1b4b274981e3ea6f9", "2026-11-04 07:47:54"], "rows": 2}
