{"at": "2026-11-04 07:56:35", "sql": "INSERT INTO spec_item (item_id, item_kind, title, item_status, module, tags, applies_to, verified_by, supersedes, superseded_by, affects, body, search_text, source_path, source_line, revision, updated_at) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE item_kind=VALUES(item_kind), title=VALUES(title), item_status=VALUES(item_status), module=VALUES(module), tags=VALUES(tags), applies_to=VALUES(applies_to), verified_by=VALUES(verified_by), supersedes=VALUES(supersedes), superseded_by=VALUES(superseded_by), affects=VALUES(affects), body=VALUES(body), search_text=VALUES(search_text), source_path=VALUES(source_path), source_line=VALUES(source_line), revision=VALUES(revision), updated_at=VALUES(updated_at)", "params": ["REQ-ORD-001", "requirement", "状态与客户筛选", "active", "order-query", "status,customer,filter,search", "ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search", "tests/test_search_basic.py", "", "", "", "`status` 与 `customer_id` 可以单独使用，也可以组合使用，语义为逻辑与。\n`status` 只接受 `pending`、`paid`、`shipped`、`cancelled`、`refunded`，其他取值返回\n`4", "REQ-ORD-001 状态与客户筛选 order-query status customer filter search ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search tests/test_sea", "validation/spec-v2/order-query.md", "6", "1b73c8ca9a7c873ec160671640a58982991966a1470a7906623fc579d0c421d8", "2026-11-04 07:56:35"], "rows": 2}
{"at": "2026-11-04 07:56:35", "sql": "INSERT INTO spec_item (item_id, item_kind, title, item_status, module, tags, applies_to, verified_by, supersedes, superseded_by, affects, body, search_text, source_path, source_line, revision, updated_at) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE item_kind=VALUES(item_kind), title=VALUES(title), item_status=VALUES(item_status), module=VALUES(module), tags=VALUES(tags), applies_to=VALUES(applies_to), verified_by=VALUES(verified_by), supersedes=VALUES(supersedes), superseded_by=VALUES(superseded_by), affects=VALUES(affects), body=VALUES(body), search_text=VALUES(search_text), source_path=VALUES(source_path), source_line=VALUES(source_line), revision=VALUES(revision), updated_at=VALUES(updated_at)", "params": ["REQ-ORD-002", "requirement", "结果排序契约", "active", "order-query", "ordering,sort,stable", "ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search", "tests/test_search_basic.py", "", "", "", "结果必须先按 `created_at` 倒序排列；`created_at` 相同的订单按 `order_id` 升序排列。\n排序必须在分页切片之前完成，任何新增筛选条件都不得改变该排序契约。", "REQ-ORD-002 结果排序契约 order-query ordering sort stable ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search tests/test_search_basic.", "validation/spec-v2/order-query.md", "18", "38330c79404c06332ca576eddf6417727b5d8659a3b4a2e511a76d3e0826b4d0", "2026-11-04 07:56:35"], "rows": 2}
{"at": "2026-11-04 07:56:35", "sql": "INSERT INTO spec_item (item_id, item_kind, title, item_status, module, tags, applies_to, verified_by, supersedes, superseded_by, affects, body, search_text, source_path, source_line, revision, updated_at) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE item_kind=VALUES(item_kind), title=VALUES(title), item_status=VALUES(item_status), module=VALUES(module), tags=VALUES(tags), applies_to=VALUES(applies_to), verified_by=VALUES(verified_by), supersedes=VALUES(supersedes), superseded_by=VALUES(superseded_by), affects=VALUES(affects), body=VALUES(body), search_text=VALUES(search_text), source_path=VALUES(source_path), source_line=VALUES(source_line), revision=VALUES(revision), updated_at=VALUES(updated_at)", "params": ["REQ-ORD-003", "requirement", "分页契约", "active", "order-query", "pagination,page,total", "ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search", "tests/test_pagination.py", "", "", "", "`page` 从 1 开始，小于 1 返回 `400 INVALID_PAGE`；`page_size` 默认 20，小于 1 返回\n`400 INVALID_PAGE_SIZE`，大于 100 时截断为 100。`total` 是过滤后、", "REQ-ORD-003 分页契约 order-query pagination page total ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search tests/test_pagination.py ", "validation/spec-v2/order-query.md", "29", "34eb54553ba87ee71cc6c371d7d7e717292a90a85cc41757bbd52db97e60c112", "2026-11-04 07:56:35"], "rows": 2}
{"at": "2026-11-04 07:56:35", "sql": "INSERT INTO spec_item (item_id, item_kind, title, item_status, module, tags, applies_to, verified_by, supersedes, superseded_by, affects, body, search_text, source_path, source_line, revision, updated_at) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE item_kind=VALUES(item_kind), title=VALUES(title), item_status=VALUES(item_status), module=VALUES(module), tags=VALUES(tags), applies_to=VALUES(applies_to), verified_by=VALUES(verified_by), supersedes=VALUES(supersedes), superseded_by=VALUES(superseded_by), affects=VALUES(affects), body=VALUES(body), search_text=VALUES(search_text), source_path=VALUES(source_path), source_line=VALUES(source_line), revision=VALUES(revision), updated_at=VALUES(updated_at)", "params": ["REQ-ORD-004", "requirement", "未知字段向后兼容", "active", "order-query", "compatibility,contract,payload", "ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search", "tests/test_search_basic.py", "", "", "", "请求体中未定义的字段必须被忽略，不得因此返回 4xx。该规则保证旧客户端在服务端新增筛选项后仍然可用；\n新增筛选项本身不得放宽本规则。", "REQ-ORD-004 未知字段向后兼容 order-query compatibility contract payload ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search tests/test_s", "validation/spec-v2/order-query.md", "41", "7b2b32ae4d1ae075e290058af81173c70ca585b49144eaa4c840d8c52585c618", "2026-11-04 07:56:35"], "rows": 2}
