{"at": "2026-11-04 08:03:06", "sql": "INSERT INTO spec_item (item_id, item_kind, title, item_status, module, tags, applies_to, verified_by, supersedes, superseded_by, affects, body, search_text, source_path, source_line, revision, updated_at) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE item_kind=VALUES(item_kind), title=VALUES(title), item_status=VALUES(item_status), module=VALUES(module), tags=VALUES(tags), applies_to=VALUES(applies_to), verified_by=VALUES(verified_by), supersedes=VALUES(supersedes), superseded_by=VALUES(superseded_by), affects=VALUES(affects), body=VALUES(body), search_text=VALUES(search_text), source_path=VALUES(source_path), source_line=VALUES(source_line), revision=VALUES(revision), updated_at=VALUES(updated_at)", "params": ["CTR-ORD-001", "contract", "搜索接口的错误响应", "active", "order-query", "error,contract,http,response", "ledgerflow.service.handle_search", "tests/test_pagination.py,tests/test_amount_validation.py", "", "", "", "可预期的入参错误必须返回 HTTP 400 与统一错误体：\n\n```json\n{\"error\": {\"code\": \"<ERROR_CODE>\", \"message\": \"<可读说明>\"}}\n```\n\n`code` 取值受控：`INVALI", "CTR-ORD-001 搜索接口的错误响应 order-query error contract http response ledgerflow.service.handle_search tests/test_pagination.py", "specs/api-contract.md", "3", "7a744a82631046668fbb0e64d8fff2ffc15c50212a7895a1b4b274981e3ea6f9", "2026-11-04 08:03:06"], "rows": 1}
{"at": "2026-11-04 08:03:06", "sql": "INSERT INTO spec_item (item_id, item_kind, title, item_status, module, tags, applies_to, verified_by, supersedes, superseded_by, affects, body, search_text, source_path, source_line, revision, updated_at) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE item_kind=VALUES(item_kind), title=VALUES(title), item_status=VALUES(item_status), module=VALUES(module), tags=VALUES(tags), applies_to=VALUES(applies_to), verified_by=VALUES(verified_by), supersedes=VALUES(supersedes), superseded_by=VALUES(superseded_by), affects=VALUES(affects), body=VALUES(body), search_text=VALUES(search_text), source_path=VALUES(source_path), source_line=VALUES(source_line), revision=VALUES(revision), updated_at=VALUES(updated_at)", "params": ["CTR-ORD-002", "contract", "搜索接口的成功响应", "active", "order-query", "response,contract,items", "ledgerflow.service.handle_search", "tests/test_search_basic.py", "", "", "", "成功响应固定为：\n\n```json\n{\"items\": [...], \"page\": 1, \"page_size\": 20, \"total\": 0}\n```\n\n`items` 中每条订单固定包含 `order_id`、`customer_i", "CTR-ORD-002 搜索接口的成功响应 order-query response contract items ledgerflow.service.handle_search tests/test_search_basic.py  成", "specs/api-contract.md", "20", "6a16146b035fb2e0bd90633471bd1b2ada4c0055174f6ac35248a1c44f0c27ab", "2026-11-04 08:03:06"], "rows": 1}
{"at": "2026-11-04 08:03:06", "sql": "INSERT INTO spec_item (item_id, item_kind, title, item_status, module, tags, applies_to, verified_by, supersedes, superseded_by, affects, body, search_text, source_path, source_line, revision, updated_at) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE item_kind=VALUES(item_kind), title=VALUES(title), item_status=VALUES(item_status), module=VALUES(module), tags=VALUES(tags), applies_to=VALUES(applies_to), verified_by=VALUES(verified_by), supersedes=VALUES(supersedes), superseded_by=VALUES(superseded_by), affects=VALUES(affects), body=VALUES(body), search_text=VALUES(search_text), source_path=VALUES(source_path), source_line=VALUES(source_line), revision=VALUES(revision), updated_at=VALUES(updated_at)", "params": ["ADR-003", "decision", "金额筛选使用 float 且上界开区间", "superseded", "order-query", "amount,float,exclusive,legacy", "", "", "", "ADR-007", "REQ-ORD-009", "早期实现为了与报表脚本对齐，把金额转成 `float` 后比较，并约定上界不包含；未传币种时默认 `CNY`。\n该方案在对账场景出现过 `0.1 + 0.2` 类精度偏差，且默认币种掩盖了跨币种查询错误，已废止。", "ADR-003 金额筛选使用 float 且上界开区间 order-query amount float exclusive legacy   REQ-ORD-009 早期实现为了与报表脚本对齐，把金额转成 `float` 后比较，并约定上", "specs/decisions.md", "6", "c9b3c4b64ee363b9ad6d26f55bc1287453a5ce9fb48467b183ca7c2097953657", "2026-11-04 08:03:06"], "rows": 1}
{"at": "2026-11-04 08:03:06", "sql": "INSERT INTO spec_item (item_id, item_kind, title, item_status, module, tags, applies_to, verified_by, supersedes, superseded_by, affects, body, search_text, source_path, source_line, revision, updated_at) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE item_kind=VALUES(item_kind), title=VALUES(title), item_status=VALUES(item_status), module=VALUES(module), tags=VALUES(tags), applies_to=VALUES(applies_to), verified_by=VALUES(verified_by), supersedes=VALUES(supersedes), superseded_by=VALUES(superseded_by), affects=VALUES(affects), body=VALUES(body), search_text=VALUES(search_text), source_path=VALUES(source_path), source_line=VALUES(source_line), revision=VALUES(revision), updated_at=VALUES(updated_at)", "params": ["ADR-007", "decision", "金额比较使用 Decimal 闭区间并要求显式币种", "active", "order-query", "amount,decimal,inclusive,currency", "", "", "ADR-003", "", "REQ-ORD-014", "金额必须以 `decimal.Decimal` 解析并比较，区间为闭区间；查询方必须显式给出 `currency`，服务端不做\n任何默认币种推断。理由：金额是财务数据，`float` 的二进制表示无法精确表达两位小数；闭区间与对账口径\n（`", "ADR-007 金额比较使用 Decimal 闭区间并要求显式币种 order-query amount decimal inclusive currency   REQ-ORD-014 金额必须以 `decimal.Decimal` 解析", "specs/decisions.md", "18", "20b3693d35144faa7848b93565f25d5d41483d6a0d4d86f39de27696773c505b", "2026-11-04 08:03:06"], "rows": 1}
{"at": "2026-11-04 08:03:06", "sql": "INSERT INTO spec_item (item_id, item_kind, title, item_status, module, tags, applies_to, verified_by, supersedes, superseded_by, affects, body, search_text, source_path, source_line, revision, updated_at) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE item_kind=VALUES(item_kind), title=VALUES(title), item_status=VALUES(item_status), module=VALUES(module), tags=VALUES(tags), applies_to=VALUES(applies_to), verified_by=VALUES(verified_by), supersedes=VALUES(supersedes), superseded_by=VALUES(superseded_by), affects=VALUES(affects), body=VALUES(body), search_text=VALUES(search_text), source_path=VALUES(source_path), source_line=VALUES(source_line), revision=VALUES(revision), updated_at=VALUES(updated_at)", "params": ["ADR-011", "decision", "未知请求字段保持静默忽略", "active", "order-query", "compatibility,contract,payload", "", "", "", "", "REQ-ORD-004", "新增筛选项时不为未知字段引入严格校验：老客户端可能携带服务端尚未识别的字段，静默忽略可以保证升级期间\n不发生 4xx。该决策只约束“未知字段”，不约束已定义字段的取值校验。", "ADR-011 未知请求字段保持静默忽略 order-query compatibility contract payload   REQ-ORD-004 新增筛选项时不为未知字段引入严格校验：老客户端可能携带服务端尚未识别的字段，静默忽略", "specs/decisions.md", "31", "645183a38aca37c64e8de847c823d58f9e569ac2eea0e3c6690f6837f68bee8f", "2026-11-04 08:03:06"], "rows": 1}
